                "id": "a31e9dc6-3696-4b18-a1b3-708bb1a3d31e",
                "body": "Spec edits before Build, from reading the code:\n\n1. **Transitions come from a server route, not wasm.** A verdict on a gated move needs the recorded check runs, threads and proof, which only the server holds.\n2. **Agent viewer by bearer token, not cookie sign-in.** `auth.rs` refuses cookie auth for anything but a person on purpose.\n\n(agent)",
